  "question": {
    "text": "If the area of the region <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math> is equal to ______________"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "27",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now on finding the intersection point we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now plotting the curve of the above function we get,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0058_1ab3d1c3337e.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 232px;\" /></p><p>Now from above diagram required&nbsp;bounded area will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
